// @corpus: fixture
// @id: TABLES-ListData
// @category: application data — the source that holds two tables (ADR-0207, ADR-0338)
// @charter: §9.2
// @milestone: E14
//
// What the database holding the lists and their items guarantees (ADR-0207):
// a deployment names it (`PW_SOURCE_LISTDATA`, ADR-0338 5.1), and its adapter
// is held to these clauses before it serves. One source, so an item's
// reference to its list is a foreign key the database holds.

module ListData

import Lists
import Items

source ListData
    holds        Lists, Items
    transactions serializable
    reads        strong
    changes      none
    sets         one_call
